                  "value": "C",
                  "label": "had to tour with their plays"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "number": 25,
              "text": "Finn and Maya both think that, compared to nineteenth-century programmes, those from the eighteenth century",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "label": "were more original"
                },
                {
                  "value": "B",
                  "label": "were more colourful"
                },
                {
                  "value": "C",
                  "label": "were more informative"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "number": 26,
              "text": "Maya doesn’t fully understand why, in the twentieth century,",
              "options": [
                {
                  "value": "A",
                  "label": "Very few theatre programmes were printed in the USA"
